{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》昨晚播出一集，何沛珈（Roxanne）與方智弘（Oscar）就「Emo」問題進行深度對話，期間Roxanne竟首度揭露喪母後曾患上抑鬱，更因網民惡評而一度想「離開呢個世界」，場面令人心酸。一向堅強樂觀的她，背後原來隱藏著如此巨大的傷痛。\n</p>\n<h2>Roxanne剖白Emo問題 憶述喪母後揸車爆喊</h2>\n<p>在約會中，Roxanne坦言對「Emo男」有所保留，全因自己也曾深陷情緒困擾而不自知。她向Oscar剖白，在母親離世後，她經歷了長達兩、三年的抑鬱時期：「我嗰時覺得自己冇乜嘢，覺得自己好似好開心咁，但原來 Emo 咗有兩、三年。」她憶述當時情緒極不穩定，經常無故哭泣：「成日都會無啦啦揸揸吓車都喊。」這段不為人知的經歷，解釋了她為何對情緒問題特別敏感。</p>\n<h2>Roxanne驚爆曾想離開世界 遭網民狠批消費家人</h2>\n<p>Roxanne接著道出當年最痛苦的時期，她指每次提起亡母都會忍不住哭泣，卻因此招來網絡欺凌：「我媽咪走咗呀嘛，跟住我每一次講起（媽咪）都會喊，然後我見網上面好多人話我消費屋企人。」面對喪親之痛與網民的無情攻擊，雙重打擊讓她情緒崩潰，她更驚爆：「再加上（當時）自己情緒唔好，我係好唔開心，最唔開心時，我真係有試過想離開呢個世界。」她坦言，現在變得強大是為了保護身邊人及一份責任感。</p>\n<h2>Oscar聞言大感心痛 直言被Roxanne成長經歷吸引</h2>\n<p>聽完Roxanne沉重的告白，Oscar坦言大為震驚及心痛。他在事後訪問中表示：「當你有認真諗過我唔想喺呢個世界，係代表你背後有幾重，壓得你有幾實。」他完全理解Roxanne為何會害怕另一半有情緒問題：「因為唔會想返番去嗰個狀態，嗰個狀態太難受，我完全明白。」同時，Oscar也被Roxanne這段痛苦的成長經歷所吸引，認為她為了別人而令自己變強的特質非常吸引他：「呢個成長幾吸引到我。」</p>\n<h2>網民心痛Roxanne經歷 力撐：你好叻好堅強</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，大批網民對Roxanne的經歷表示心痛，並紛紛留言為她打氣，力撐她非常堅強。網民留言指：「聽到Roxanne講想離開世界嗰度，真係好心痛…」、「網民啲留言真係可以好傷人，Roxanne你好叻，撐住！」、「估唔到佢平時笑得咁開心，背後有咁嘅故事。」、「Oscar真係好體貼，完全明白佢嘅感受，呢對好夾。」、「Roxanne你好堅強，加油！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16026649666b03c2ec4bfc5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_16026649666b03c2ec4bfc5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_26467786b03c2f439cd0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_26467786b03c2f439cd0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_6536538576b03c2fb262a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_6536538576b03c2fb262a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21079552046b03c328b2d6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21079552046b03c328b2d6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_19863539336b03c330892be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_19863539336b03c330892be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_10797467586b03c33abeebd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_10797467586b03c33abeebd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_2314654836b03c37e3ab5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_2314654836b03c37e3ab5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.915479+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1266,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:06:02.547110+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:43.532817+00:00","content_hash":"a27eadebb5b22532fb1a60f678a3cb6f394a7ee757ad19441e32f45bf7a657b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}